url: "https://github.com/SAMBPS-DTaaS/HIF-TF-Locator"
abstract: >-
  Single-ended joint estimator of HIF location alpha and arc
  resistance R_x that fits a state-space transfer function H_model
  to the power-frequency single-bin DFT admittance via a two-stage
  optimiser, under independent dual-channel additive white Gaussian
  noise.  Phase-0 release: editorial baseline + reproducibility
  scaffolding (manuscript v2, references.bib, Appendix A,
  optimiser, build_dataset, capture / timing / sensitivity
  artefacts, MATLAB + Python cross-runtime tests).
